        "title": "<p>A custom plan made for your dog's needs.</p>",
        "heading_highlight_type": "circle",
        "heading_size": 100,
        "text_content": "Your dedicated expert (no bots here!) will create a unique custom online dog training plan with weekly milestones and homework based on your dog’s breed, adoption story and training knowledge — all designed to meet your goals.",
